 "title": "20 V, 4.5 A N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel enhancement MOSFET on a low-voltage trench process, in the three-lead SOT-23. It blocks 20 V and is rated 4.5 A continuous at 25 °C ambient (2.8 A at 100 °C) and 30 A pulsed. Maximum on-resistance is 25 mΩ at 4.5 V gate drive, 32 mΩ at 2.5 V and 46 mΩ at 1.8 V, with the threshold between 0.4 V and 1 V. Named uses are battery protection, load switching and power management.",
